{
  "title": "TinyScratch",
  "children": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "lines": [
        "A generative auto-",
        "scratcher. Press a",
        "pad and it writes a",
        "scratch for your",
        "sample, plays it in",
        "time with the song,",
        "and lets you keep",
        "the ones you like."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Getting Started",
      "lines": [
        "1 Touch dial 1 and",
        "  press the jog",
        "  wheel: the Pads",
        "  screen opens.",
        "2 Press Generate",
        "  (a pad). A clip",
        "  plays at once.",
        "3 Tap an empty clip",
        "  pad to keep it.",
        "4 Hold a clip pad",
        "  1.5 s to delete.",
        "5 Press Play on the",
        "  Move: clips",
        "  follow the",
        "  transport."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "The Pads",
      "lines": [
        "Bottom row: cut",
        "pads (the fader),",
        "or cues with no",
        "clip playing.",
        "",
        "Row 2: the 8",
        "samples. Hold an",
        "empty User pad to",
        "record.",
        "",
        "Top 2 rows: 14",
        "clips, then",
        "Generate and Auto."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "The Dials",
      "children": [
        {
          "title": "Pads Screen",
          "lines": [
            "1 Style",
            "2 Length",
            "3 Drag",
            "4 Humanise",
            "5 Groove",
            "6 Echo",
            "7 Forwards",
            "8 Finish",
            "",
            "Touch a dial to see",
            "its name and value."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Main Page",
          "lines": [
            "1 Pads screen",
            "2 Load Sample",
            "3 Style",
            "4 Length",
            "5 Forwards",
            "6 Finish",
            "7 Echo",
            "8 Groove"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Playback Page",
          "lines": [
            "Swing, Humanise,",
            "Bite, Clip Depth,",
            "Clip Offset, Drag",
            "and Gain.",
            "",
            "They change how a",
            "clip plays, never",
            "the clip itself."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Pad Play Page",
          "lines": [
            "Note Gate, Vel to",
            "Vol, Cue Pads and",
            "Taste Log."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Styles",
      "lines": [
        "Improv: a phrase of",
        "strokes of every",
        "length, answered by",
        "a changed copy (use",
        "4 bars to hear it).",
        "",
        "Named styles:",
        "Baby, Cuts,",
        "Military, Scribble,",
        "Stab, Chirp,",
        "Transform, Flare,",
        "Crab, Orbit, Drag",
        "and Tear."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Groove",
      "lines": [
        "Improv only. Keeps",
        "a clip to a drum",
        "groove: strokes land",
        "on the snare, kicks",
        "are left clear, there",
        "are rests, and a fill",
        "ends each phrase.",
        "",
        "It leaves room for a",
        "beat: thin alone,",
        "good over a song.",
        "At 0% Improv is as",
        "it was.",
        "",
        "Grooves: Boom-bap,",
        "Four on the floor,",
        "Breaks, Half-time,",
        "Funk, Dembow, Open.",
        "",
        "GRV60 FUNK on a clip",
        "is its amount and",
        "groove."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Clip Pages",
      "lines": [
        "4 pages of 14 clips",
        "for each sample.",
        "Press > and < (right",
        "and left arrows) to",
        "turn the page.",
        "",
        "A playing clip keeps",
        "playing on its page;",
        "its page mark",
        "blinks. Auto plays",
        "the clips of every",
        "page."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Samples",
      "lines": [
        "Ahhh and Fresssh",
        "are built in.",
        "",
        "Record a User sample",
        "by holding its empty",
        "pad (4 s at most), or",
        "use Load Sample for a",
        ".wav file.",
        "",
        "Hold a User pad 1.5 s",
        "to remove it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Taste Log",
      "lines": [
        "On by default. It",
        "logs each clip you",
        "keep, pass over or",
        "delete, in",
        "taste_log.csv in the",
        "module folder.",
        "",
        "It never leaves your",
        "Move. Switch it off",
        "on Pad Play, or",
        "delete the file."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
